	the section there, so the row stays independent — the tags box above can grow all
	the lines it likes without moving anything here sideways. The tools box is sized
	by its pills rather than by the row, so Project follows straight after it instead
	of being pushed to the far edge; when the pills fill the width, Project wraps to
	the line below.
-->

